lass=\"model_title\" data-en=\"发表时间\" data-zh=\"发表时间\">            发表时间           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"期刊名称\" data-zh=\"期刊名称\">            期刊名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           电机与控制学报          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"期卷\" data-zh=\"期卷\">            期卷           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">            简单介绍           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"549589f8fce6b64635a2b33f59a353d2part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\"> Biographical Information</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"79a9b6d881f6822b3e26e75695a61720\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"a20bae4c689e761790ceff62f3a2d47d\">           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Biographical Information</span></strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Ni Fenglei, research fellow, doctoral supervisor. He is the recipient of the National High-Level Talent Program.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">His primary research focuses on space robotics and humanoid technologies. He has led numerous research programs, including</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">the National Natural Science Foundation Programs, national ministry-level programs, a sub-program of the National High-Tech R&amp;D Program (863 Program), and independent research programs supported by the State Key Laboratory, among other research projects. He has published over 70 papers and one monograph, participated in compiling two monographs, and granted over 20 national invention patents. His awards include a second prize of the State Technological Invention Award (third contributor), a second prize of the State Technological Invention Award (sixth contributor).</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;line-height:125%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"><br></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;line-height:125%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Education Background</span></strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"\">Ph.D., 2002.09-2006.12, Mechanical and Electronic Engineering, Robotics Institute, School of Mechatronics Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology, Mentor: Academician Liu Hong</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">M.S., 2000.09-2002.07, Instrument Science and Technology, Harbin Institute of Technology, Mentor: Professor Zhao Yongping</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">B.E., 1994.09-1998.07, Industrial Electric Automation y, Harbin Institute of Technology, Mentor: Professor Xu Dianguo</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0;line-height:125%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Professional Experience</span></strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2019.12-present. Harbin Institute of Technology, Robotics Institute, Research Fellow</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2012.12-2019.12. Harbin Institute of Technology, Robotics Institute, Associate Professor</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2007.04-2012.12. Harbin Institute of Technology, Robotics Institute, Lecturer</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;line-height:125%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"><br></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;line-height:125%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Research Interests</span></strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Space Robotics Technology</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height:125%\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Humanoid Technology</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"048a91a4ac0a8203ead8374ba520d2e2part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(87, 122, 149);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"3001\">基本信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"679ad3644a25b4646c58c5d9aa460fe6\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"0ed23650ee6e3ae94efaeabd438226b1\">           <p><span style=\"\">Ni Fenglei, research fellow, doctoral supervisor. He is the recipient of the National High-Level Talent Program.</span></p>           <p><span style=\"\"><br></span></p>           <p><span style=\"\">His primary research focuses on space robotics and humanoid technologies. He has led numerous research programs, including the National Natural Science Foundation Programs, national ministry-level programs, a sub-program of the National High-Tech R&amp;D Program (863 Program), and independent research programs supported by the State Key Laboratory, among other research projects. He has published over 70 papers and one monograph, participated in compiling two monographs, and granted over 20 national invention patents. His awards include a second prize of the State Technological Invention Award (third contributor), a second prize of the State Technological Invention Award (sixth contributor).</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>   </div>   </div> </body></html>"